{{!-- The settlement sheet's banner: Stonetop's own `.steading-header`, and like Stonetop's it
      carries NO picture (the user's call, 2026-10-14): the actor's image (the place's map, or the
      village icon; actors/settlement/settlement-portrait.js) is for the Actors sidebar, and is
      changed from there or the token config. The name is set in the steading title's display face;
      under it, the line of book facts that says what kind of place it is (kind, headcount). Size
      lives in the stat bar below, where Stonetop keeps its own.

      With the window header's wrench off (`editable` false) the banner's fields are disabled and
      read as text, as they do for a player.

      The two chips park at the banner's far end, where Stonetop's season clock sits. Plain named
      inputs, submitted by core on change; a reader who cannot edit gets them disabled, which the
      sheet's CSS draws as text. `stonetop-sheet-header` is what the tab rail measures to hang
      itself below (utils/tab-rail.js). --}}
<header class="steading-header stonetop-sheet-header stonetop-settlement-header">
	<div class="steading-header-name stonetop-settlement-ident">
		<input class="stonetop-settlement-name" type="text" name="name" value="{{actor.name}}"
		       placeholder="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.namePlaceholder"}}" aria-label="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.name"}}"{{#unless editable}} disabled{{/unless}}>
		<div class="stonetop-settlement-facts">
			<input class="stonetop-settlement-kind" type="text" name="system.kind" value="{{system.kind}}"
			       placeholder="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.kindPlaceholder"}}" aria-label="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.kind"}}"{{#unless editable}} disabled{{/unless}}>
			<input class="stonetop-settlement-headcount" type="text" name="system.headcount" value="{{system.headcount}}"
			       placeholder="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.headcountPlaceholder"}}" aria-label="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.headcount"}}"{{#unless editable}} disabled{{/unless}}>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="stonetop-settlement-head-actions">
		{{#if canGazetteer}}
		<button type="button" class="stonetop-settlement-chip" data-action="openGazetteer" data-reader-ok
		        data-tooltip="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.gazetteerTooltip"}}">
			<i class="fa-solid fa-book-open" inert></i>
			<span>{{localize "stonetop.settlement.gazetteer"}}{{#if sourcePage}} ({{sourcePage}}){{/if}}</span>
		</button>
		{{/if}}
		{{#if isGM}}
		<button type="button" class="stonetop-settlement-chip{{#if hidden}} stonetop-settlement-chip--off{{/if}}" data-action="toggleHidden"
		        data-tooltip="{{localize "stonetop.settlement.visibilityTooltip"}}">
			<i class="fa-solid {{#if hidden}}fa-eye-slash{{else}}fa-eye{{/if}}" inert></i>
			<span>{{#if hidden}}{{localize "stonetop.settlement.hidden"}}{{else}}{{localize "stonetop.settlement.shown"}}{{/if}}</span>
		</button>
		{{/if}}
	</div>
</header>
